{
  "name": "dsh-todo-float-ball",
  "version": "0.14.7",
  "description": "DSH todo 悬浮球：常驻可拖动悬浮球实时显示当前会话 todo_write 任务清单进度（完成数/总数/进行中任务名），带百分比进度环；Shadow DOM 样式隔离，点击折叠/展开完整清单，右键胶囊模式；状态颜色（待办蓝/进行中橙脉动/完成绿）。数据双路同步：权威会话投影帧为主 + MutationObserver 抓官方 todo 面板为辅，旧计划自动归档为历史不会被误算进进度。可固定多会话并排查看，130 款共享皮肤（官方主题/招牌特效/克制精选三组 + 随系统深浅自动）。宿主端每轮注入 todo 纪律并硬性要求首个工具调用为 todo_write。双端可用（Desktop 桌面端 + Web 网页端）。零遥测，仅一条本机回环健康路由。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "sideEffects": false,
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "!lib/*.bak",
    "!lib/*.bak-*",
    "!lib/*.broken-*",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "docs/*.md",
    "docs/images/*",
    "LICENSE",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README-es.md",
    "README-pt.md",
    "README-hi.md",
    "README-en.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-todo-float-ball/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "todo",
    "悬浮球",
    "float-ball",
    "task-list",
    "progress",
    "ui"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh": ">=0.1.7-rc.1"
  },
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.7.0"
}
